# Validation for MaintenanceElevator
# Two-stop industrial elevator. INTERACT toggles SUBIR/BAJAR on the root,
# which calls call_elevator(). Travel is 8m at 2 m/s (~4s per trip), so waits
# are sized to capture: bottom idle, mid-rise, top, and mid-descent.
LOAD_PROP res://core_v2/props/elevator/MaintenanceElevator.tscn
WAIT 1.0
SCREENSHOT 0_idle

# Call elevator up from PB.
INTERACT
WAIT 2.0
SCREENSHOT 1_mid

# Let it reach the top (1°). Hatch opens just before arrival.
WAIT 2.5
SCREENSHOT 2_active

# Call it back down to PB.
INTERACT
WAIT 4.5
SCREENSHOT 3_off
